        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Sea Hag's Bargain"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, occult)\n\nThe sea hag can make a bargain with a willing creature, who must be of sound mind. The creature gives away a special or cherished quality\u2014such as its courage, its beauty, or its voice\u2014in exchange for a boon or a promise from the sea hag. As long as the sea hag keeps her end of the bargain, the only way to restore the lost quality is to defeat the sea hag or make another bargain for its return."
            },
            "id": "24a97696-d9a6-49de-b2cb-d505fb055a88",
